:null,"time":"","place":"BP 30 156 Montée du Parc Saint-Benoît, Digne-les-Bains","lat":44.109482,"lng":6.228852,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241945901,"description":"Perché sur les hauteurs de la ville, le musée promenade offre un panorama exceptionnel et invite à une expérience immersive mêlant nature, histoire géologique et art. Il est la porte d’entrée et le centre d’interprétation du Géoparc de Haute-Provence.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Great_gallery_of_evolution%2C_Paris_1_July_2015.jpg/960px-Great_gallery_of_evolution%2C_Paris_1_July_2015.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Joe deSousa, CC0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-65913166-d5a8-32e4-a596-856ebf1b0594","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Camion Pizza du Château","date":null,"time":"","place":"Place Jean Jaurès, Château-Arnoux-Saint-Auban","lat":44.093005,"lng":6.009343,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241945901,"description":"Pizzas à emporter 7j/7 de 18h30 à 22h.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Water_reflection_of_the_Orangerie_garden_and_Palace_of_Versailles_with_blue_sky_in_France.jpg/960px-Water_reflection_of_the_Orangerie_garden_and_Palace_of_Versailles_with_blue_sky_in_France.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Basile Morin, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-cef4246e-ef6d-3b7e-8a6b-afe677f15496","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Cathédrale Saint-Jérôme","date":null,"time":"","place":"Rue Tour des Prisons, Digne-les-Bains","lat":44.092042,"lng":6.236059,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241945901,"description":"Saint-Jérôme connut de nombreux aménagements jusqu’à son aspect actuel, de style néo-gothique, datant du XIXe siècle. Agrandie et embellie, elle est érigée en co-cathédrale en 1962 et classée Monument Historique.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Cath%C3%A9drale_St_J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me_Digne_04.jpg/960px-Cath%C3%A9drale_St_J%C3%A9r%C3%B4me_Digne_04.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"dt-place-46963a15-cc9d-34c2-b650-a70a377e83f1","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Théâtre Durance","date":null,"time":"","place":"Les Lauzières, Château-Arnoux-Saint-Auban","lat":44.083722,"lng":6.003453,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241945901,"description":"Scène nationale, programmation pluridisciplinaire (théâtre, danse, musique, cirque).\r\nLa capacité de la salle est de 323 places assises en gradin et 900 places debout.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Th%C3%A9%C3%A2tre_des_Bouffes_du_Nord_02.jpg/960px-Th%C3%A9%C3%A2tre_des_Bouffes_du_Nord_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Coyau, CC BY-SA 3.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-251f6010-1e29-3368-8f27-5421db4e20f9","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Musée Gassendi","date":null,"time":"","place":"64 boulevard Gassendi, Digne-les-Bains","lat":44.09387,"lng":6.238164,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241947160,"description":"Attention : Musée fermé pour travaux à compter du 22 décembre 2025 pour une durée prévisionnelle de 18 mois.\r\nLe Musée Gassendi présente des collections encyclopédiques dans le domaine de l'art, de l'histoire locale, sciences physiques et naturelles.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Mus%C3%A9e_Gassendi%2C_River_of_Earth_-_dsmm00314.jpg/960px-Mus%C3%A9e_Gassendi%2C_River_of_Earth_-_dsmm00314.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"dt-place-35a27991-6d04-3861-92f7-b5767737bed7","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Le Château de Malijai","date":null,"time":"","place":"5 Place du Château, Malijai","lat":44.044645,"lng":6.029541,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241947160,"description":"Le Château de Malijai est, dans cette partie des Alpes Provençales, l'un des rares exemples de l'architecture seigneuriale du XVIIe siècle.Le Château de Malijai, construit entre 1635 et 1643, fût acheter par la famille Noguier en 1766 et restauré en 1770.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/FR-04-Malijai2.JPG/960px-FR-04-Malijai2.JPG?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"dt-place-853e9fb7-9dc5-3879-965c-ba51ba74b4ca","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Musée de la Lavande","date":null,"time":"","place":"32, boulevard Gassendi, Digne-les-Bains","lat":44.091988,"lng":6.233758,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1793241947160,"description":"Découvrez l'histoire de la culture de la lavande autour de Digne-les-Bains, depuis 1900.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/West_facade_of_the_Cour_Carr%C3%A9e%2C_Louvre_Museum%2C_Paris_21_June_2014_002.jpg/960px-West_facade_of_the_Cour_Carr%C3%A9e%2C_Louvre_Museum%2C_Paris_21_June_2014_002.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Dennis G. Jarvis, CC BY-SA 2.0","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-c3fb3738-2741-3546-bf7c-3bd446ed9452","isPlace":true,"scene":"expo","city":"digne","category":"À voir","title":"Ecomusée La Javie","da